OL,5,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess Gillam is joined by the
OL,7,     FAmerican cellist and composer
OL,8,     FClarice Jensen for a listening
OL,9,     Fparty, including music by Ligeti,
OL,10,     FStravinsky and Bill Callahan.
OL,11,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,12,     FJuan Diego Florez stars as Tonio
OL,13,     Fin Donizetti's comic masterpiece
OL,14,     Ffrom The Royal Opera, where a
OL,15,     Fspirited young woman raised by a
OL,16,     Fregiment of soldiers chooses
OL,17,     Fbetween love and duty.
